  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "SWE-CARE",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tSWE-CARE: A Comprehensiveness-aware Benchmark for Code Review Evaluation\n\t\n\n\n  \n    \n  \n    \n  \n    \n  \n    \n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Description\n\t\n\nSWE-CARE (Software Engineering - Comprehensive Analysis and Review Evaluation) is a comprehensiveness-aware benchmark for evaluating Large Language Models (LLMs) on repository-level code review tasks. The dataset features real-world code review scenarios from popular open-source Python and Java repositories, with comprehensive metadata and\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/inclusionAI/SWE-CARE.",
  "alternateName": [
    "inclusionAI/SWE-CARE"
  ],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "inclusionAI",
    "url": "https://huggingface.co/inclusionAI"
  },
